; claude: the heightmap kit (see docs/claude_notes/plans/plan_games3d.md,
; section 6): a terrain as a grid of heights, an island made up by
; diamond-square; the ground under a point, a line of sight, the colors.
; Used by TinyComanche (drawn in "Voxel Space", column by column)
; and TinyComanche3d (as triangles, with a z-buffer), and by
; TinyZeldaOcarina for Hyrule Field (its own heights, a valley in
; hills, the generator giving only the bumps). In the package
; elm_playground_gamekits, as elm_playground_gamekits.kit_heightmap.
